description = "+3 INT, +4 WIS, +25 mana. 2 card slots. On-self: a crit with an offensive card buds a bow turret — 6 damage, attacks every 5 tempo, dies to any damage or after 2 attacks; up to 4 at once. This bow and its bow summons gain +2 damage and +5% crit chance per living bow summon. Grants Spirit Bow (Maintain): a spirit bow that stalks your enemies, 1 square per tempo, loosing a 10-damage shot every 4 tempo (65 mana, 3 tempo)."
